# DukaanSathi — Standalone Client Mode
# No external Firebase or live API keys are required to build and run the frontend.
# All data (Sales, Digital Khata, Inventory, Auth) operates reliably via client-side storage.

# Optional: Server-side Gemini API (if backend cloud functions are configured in the future)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
